stom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T09:08:23-08:00","id":1025973,"title":"","content":"Huh. Neat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T09:29:53-08:00","id":1025986,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LLegume</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter#post1025905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Monday Meeting Notes announced starting to do kickstarters for 2ed products including Changeling and Hunter where previously 'old' 2ed game lines haven't gotten them. I'm really happy that this stance has changed and I'm already itching for a beautifully printed prestige edition to match my Dark Eras book on the shelf... Take my money?</div> </div> </div> </div> This x1,000,000, I hope they do a Changeling kickstarter soon, the anthology is already in editing, and CTL2e Corebook should be heading out of development any time now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T15:43:29-08:00","id":1026190,"title":"","content":"Yeeees! I'll start saving up money now! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, call-shoting this now: the Kickstarter video will feature the song &quot;Darkest Child&quot; by Kevin MacLeod.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T16:51:00-08:00","id":1026221,"title":"","content":"I hope I'll be able to afford this kickstarter when it goes up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T17:04:48-08:00","id":1026227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1026221#post1026221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope I'll be able to afford this kickstarter when it goes up.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hope the Kickstarter will still be up after a minute from all the attention it'll get.<br /> <br /> I kid, but seriously, compared to Beast, which was its own title with no history, Changeling has a boatload more history behind it and fans from the first edition, much less Dreaming fans who crossed over one way or the other. Beast got backed rapidly; I get the feeling Changeling may rival Homestuck in how fast the original total is eclipsed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T18:34:49-08:00","id":1026255,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar99_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"99\" data-vbnamecard=\"99\">ArcaneArts</a> Hopingbfor the other half of your Paris as a stretch goal!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T19:34:25-08:00","id":1026272,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1026255#post1026255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar99_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"99\" data-vbnamecard=\"99\">ArcaneArts</a> Hopingbfor the other half of your Paris as a stretch goal!</div> </div> </div> </div>If I get 5000 more words as an expansion, I would both be thrilled by being able to add the Sleeping Lions into the book and terrified because that means the courts would have to be even more different.<br /> <br /> Sleeping Lions is a variant on Scherazade as it stands now, based on the societal structural theme of &quot;similar but different&quot; that exists in Paris(The Rosiere may not find safety in the Seasonal Courts, but a few centuries of proudly hosting them means they are still a major identity factor, and as such the lot is interesting in how it is and clearly isn't like the Seasonal Courts) and showing how ideas can change across cities. If it ended up in the core, I would have to make it far more radically different based on the fact that we have Toronto.<br /> <br /> Not that I would mind, because it would still be this place where I would get to blend Muslim, Mandinka, Berber, Roma, and Slavic cultures into this shared rebellion and embrace of individual cultures against the more classically European Rosiere, but I would have to make it something more different than it stands.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 01-03-2017, 10:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T21:39:49-08:00","id":1026313,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1026272#post1026272\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I get 5000 more words as an expansion, I would both be thrilled by being able to add the Sleeping Lions into the book and terrified because that means the courts would have to be even more different.<br /> <br /> Sleeping Lions is a variant on Scherazade as it stands now, based on the societal structural theme of &amp;quot;similar but different&amp;quot; that exists in Paris(The Rosiere may not find safety in the Seasonal Courts, but a few centuries of proudly hosting them means they are still a major identity factor, and as such the lot is interesting in how it is and clearly isn't like the Seasonal Courts) and showing how ideas can change across cities. If it ended up in the core, I would have to make it far more radically different based on the fact that we have Toronto.<br /> <br /> Not that I would mind, because it would still be this place where I would get to blend Muslim, Mandinka, Berber, Roma, and Slavic cultures into this shared rebellion and embrace of individual cultures against the more classically European Rosiere, but I would have to make it something more different than it stands.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be overjoyed with that even aa I was slightly terrified of the treatment of the Roma, who are historically handled poorly both in roleplaying and in France.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T23:30:52-08:00","id":1026356,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1026313#post1026313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'd be overjoyed with that even aa I was slightly terrified of the treatment of the Roma, who are historically handled poorly both in roleplaying and in France.</div> </div> </div> </div>The fact that they've been treated poorly by France is sort of the point-the contention between the Rosiere and Sleeping Lions is loose enough that it doesn't have to be about the various contentions and is focused primarily on the problems of Bulwarks interacting with one another(or the Sovereigns thinking it does), but I created the notice about the Sleeping Lions long ago because I felt like conversations should be allowed to be more possible in this fictional space where ending up on the outside is a major narrative conflict. Sleeping Lions isn't necessarily about the real societal problems France and especially Paris has, but I wanted to draw from that well all the same.<br /> <br /> As for the Roma, it's a thing I've been contending, because I do not want another in a long damn line of ass-backwards portrayals of them as tricksters and curse-bringers, which is hard in a game about curse-bringing tricksters. I might not do them at all, but on the other hand, there is the siren call to finally do it <i>right</i>. Representation in games is important, and if there's any group where it's long overdue.....well, there's a list, but the Roma are definitely on it.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Mind you, this is all dependent on either a) There being a Stretch Goal for it or &quot;Scatter and Wilt&quot;, or b) goals for expanding parts of the book. Which there might not be. Otherwise, it's back to blogpost/&quot;Scatter and Wilt&quot; mini-supplement ala Lore of the Deceived/pieced into other books. And how <i>that</i> turns out depends on how much more people want after reading it's final form as is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 01-04-2017, 02:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-04T08:53:15-08:00","id":1026546,"title":"","content":"I have a feeling that most stretch goals will be for future books and other products, maybe a boost to the art budget, based on A) things that we're said during the Scion Kick starter about what they'd learned from past kickstarters and how they wanted to do stretch goals in the future and B) it's too far into it's development for additional words added, art budget maybe, but not more word count.<br /> <br /> So this is my guess Stretch goals will mostly include adding more content to The Hedge, a possible Antagonist Book, possibly a Changeling Player's Guide, an Interactive Audio Earplay Story, maybe a novel given that the Changeling anthology is almost done.<br /> <br /> @Milo if you don't have the cash right away, donate a dollar for now to &quot;save your spot&quot; and then after the Kickstarter you can upgrade your donation to get what you really want via backer kit or whatever its called.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-04T09:07:43-08:00","id":1026555,"title":"","content":"^All of that is a very realistic expectation.<br /> <br /> Phallic is pretty good in certain conversations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-04T10:43:12-08:00","id":1026603,"title":"","content":"And other social situatiOH! Omegaphallic. Ok. Yes.<br /> <br /> <br /> I don't see much use of a Kickstarter (from Onyx Path's side, that is) for Changeling. There's obviously a market for it (based both on 1E and the reception of the 2E previews) and it's quite far into production already. The fans would most likely love whatever stretch goals might be (and I would personally enjoy reading it as well despite Changeling not being my &quot;main&quot; gameline) but I recall someone (I think <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar269_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"269\" data-vbnamecard=\"269\">Charlaquin</a>) writing a post in another thread some time back about the dangers of kickstarter bloating. I think Geist (as the seemingly least popular 1E gameline) and then Deviant (as a new gameline) would benefit the most from Kickstarters. That would also make every other new core book get a kickstarter to spread it out a bit, unless I've messed up the schedule.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-04T10:49:33-08:00","id":1026608,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar99_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"99\" data-vbnamecard=\"99\">ArcaneArts</a> I've been craving a good representation of the Roma in fiction and RP. So All n' All I do hope I see it somewhere. I've seen some things, like one of the local LARPs in my area, that do really well in parts (such as life as a Roma, attitudes on the Roma, and actual customs and culture) which is nice to see though they get many other parts cringe-worthy (such as still using the word 'Gypsy', and focusing on things like cursing others. Both leave a bad taste in my mouth). <br /> <br /> So I really do want to see a good and faithful representation of that culture especially since there's some great inspiration there but I've just not seen a good one yet. So I hope you're able to write it in some form <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I think that you could do it pretty well ^.^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-04T10:58:59-08:00","id":1026610,"title":"","content":"I agree with <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar11887_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11887\" data-vbnamecard=\"11887\">Tessie</a> . That said I would fund a C:tL kickstarter. IMO, there's enough market for a main rulebook and likely a quickstart guide so maybe focus the kickstarter on supplements?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1630-jacob","name":"Jacob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1630_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"681"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-04T10:59:23-08:00","id":1026612,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1026603#post1026603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And other social situatiOH! Omegaphallic. Ok. Yes.<br /> <br /> <br /> I don't see much use of a Kickstarter (from Onyx Path's side, that is) for Changeling. There's obviously a market for it (based both on 1E and the reception of the 2E previews) and it's quite far into production already. The fans would most likely love whatever stretch goals might be (and I would personally enjoy reading it as well despite Changeling not being my &amp;quot;main&amp;quot; gameline) but I recall someone (I think <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>) writing a post in another thread some time back about the dangers of kickstarter bloating. I think Geist (as the seemingly least popular 1E gameline) and then Deviant (as a new gameline) would benefit the most from Kickstarters. That would also make every other new core book get a kickstarter to spread it out a bit, unless I've messed up the schedule.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I have talked about backer fatigue as one of the possible reasons Onyx might have only been Kickstarting new games and not 2e updates for existing games. I'm no marketing expert though, I was just making a semi-educated guess. If they're going to do it with Lost and Vigil, they probably have good reason to suspect the gains from kickstarting them will outweigh potential losses due to said fatigue.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-04T16:21:40-08:00","id":1026752,"title":"","content":"They haven't done the traditionally published deluxe prestige editions for non-kickstart games, which is what I want most of all for changeling. I don't back every one of OP's kickstarters because for most game lines I'm happy with just getting the pdf or PoD versions. Changeling is one that I would really like the traditional publishing quality for because I'll <i>use</i> it. That said, they're also talking about getting more books done by Indy Press Revolution so I'd be happy with that too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10769-llegume","name":"LLegume","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T07:14:33-08:00","id":1027004,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1026555#post1026555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">^All of that is a very realistic expectation.<br /> <br /> Phallic is pretty good in certain conversations.</div> </div> </div> </div>LMFAO, I have my moments.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T07:27:44-08:00","id":1027008,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1026612#post1026612\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, I have talked about backer fatigue as one of the possible reasons Onyx might have only been Kickstarting new games and not 2e updates for existing games. I'm no marketing expert though, I was just making a semi-educated guess. If they're going to do it with Lost and Vigil, they probably have good reason to suspect the gains from kickstarting them will outweigh potential losses due to said fatigue.</div> </div> </div> </div> I think they have an opening right now or soon for a Changeling Kickstarter without causing backer fatigue. <br /> <br /> A Changeling kickstarter is important because A) it make sure what happened to Vampire 2e doesn't happen to Changeling 2e where it goes without supplements for years, kickstarter books get prioritized B) it will provide Onyx Path with valuable marketing data C) if any of the remaining Onyx Path setting that are unfinished have a big enough market for a prestige edition it's Changeling: The Lost D) pure self interest, Changeling: The Lost is my favourite CoD splat so yeah I want a kickstarter for it, you get better deals with the kickstarters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T15:35:06-08:00","id":1027332,"title":"","content":"I think it would be cool if we recommended at the kick starter fan made kiths we would like to see in upcoming source books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T17:28:27-08:00","id":1027362,"title":"","content":"You can recommend whatever you want in the comments section of the kickstarter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T19:59:45-08:00","id":1027391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LLegume</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter#post1025905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Monday Meeting Notes announced starting to do kickstarters for 2ed products including Changeling and Hunter where previously 'old' 2ed game lines haven't gotten them. I'm really happy that this stance has changed and I'm already itching for a beautifully printed prestige edition to match my Dark Eras book on the shelf... Take my money?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Bringing famous futurama meme: Shut up and take my money (and my kids, and half of my life through Aracdia deal...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2637-qendi","name":"qendi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T20:40:43-08:00","id":1027406,"title":"","content":"I know nothing about any of this, just to preface. I heard about it in the meeting notes, same as you. But, if it's a thing we end up doing, what kind of expanded material would you all like to see? Assume I'm already looking at treatment of additional kith options, and of course I've already discussed further treatment of the Hedge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T20:49:48-08:00","id":1027409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027406#post1027406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know nothing about any of this, just to preface. I heard about it in the meeting notes, same as you. But, if it's a thing we end up doing, what kind of expanded material would you all like to see? Assume I'm already looking at treatment of additional kith options, and of course I've already discussed further treatment of the Hedge.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Definitely dreaming and pledges. Dreaming has IMO tons of unfulfilled potential and in 1ED it got much to little attention. Pledges were much better explained and <i>Rites of Spring</i> which neatly complimented Corebook material but I'd love to see more. Also new court system and interesting settings would be great additional materials as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2637-qendi","name":"qendi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T20:53:56-08:00","id":1027411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027406#post1027406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know nothing about any of this, just to preface. I heard about it in the meeting notes, same as you. But, if it's a thing we end up doing, what kind of expanded material would you all like to see? Assume I'm already looking at treatment of additional kith options, and of course I've already discussed further treatment of the Hedge.</div> </div> </div> </div>More on Fetches and Huntsmen, mostly tools.<br /> <br /> Another City, maybe get Budapest or Cape Town back in, or maybe Directional in the core? (Also willing to toss in a Salt Lake City write-up, since I'm living here now, maybe, kind of.)<br /> <br /> More of the standard merits.<br /> <br /> Expanded Storyteller Chapter. By, like, a lot. We've got good stuff in there.<br /> <br /> More Hedge. Hedge Hedge Hedge.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Ensorcellment, unless I'm blind and missing it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T20:59:17-08:00","id":1027413,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027411#post1027411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Expanded Storyteller Chapter. By, like, a lot. We've got good stuff in there.</div> </div> </div> </div>YES, YES, YES, and YES","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2637-qendi","name":"qendi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:10:12-08:00","id":1027416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027406#post1027406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know nothing about any of this, just to preface. I heard about it in the meeting notes, same as you. But, if it's a thing we end up doing, what kind of expanded material would you all like to see? Assume I'm already looking at treatment of additional kith options, and of course I've already discussed further treatment of the Hedge.</div> </div> </div> </div>More settings and Courts, please! The cities have been my favorite part of the 2e cores so far and I'd love to see more of them, especially if we could get the other half of Paris, the Directional Courts back in, and/or some more non-Western settings. I'm sure that's a goofy thing to want more of, but I love them so much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:12:32-08:00","id":1027417,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027416#post1027416\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> More settings and Courts, please! The cities have been my favorite part of the 2e cores so far and I'd love to see more of them, especially if we could get the other half of Paris, the Directional Courts back in, and/or some more non-Western settings. I'm sure that's a goofy thing to want more of, but I love them so much.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm DEFINITELY interested in doing more Courts and Freeholds. I love them, too. I don't know that I'd favor putting them in the core, but they're definitely a place I'd love to hit home on hard. Hell, I'd love to do a whole book of them in a perfect situation. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>qendi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027409#post1027409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Definitely dreaming and pledges. Dreaming has IMO tons of unfulfilled potential and in 1ED it got much to little attention. Pledges were much better explained and <i>Rites of Spring</i> which neatly complimented Corebook material but I'd love to see more. Also new court system and interesting settings would be great additional materials as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>Dreaming would be a thing I'd love to work with. I know we gave it a little more attention in this book, but we had some hardcore space limitations. I think we have some great building blocks to start with. <br /> <br /> Pledges would also be a cool thing to work with. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027411#post1027411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More on Fetches and Huntsmen, mostly tools.<br /> <br /> Another City, maybe get Budapest or Cape Town back in, or maybe Directional in the core? (Also willing to toss in a Salt Lake City write-up, since I'm living here now, maybe, kind of.)<br /> <br /> More of the standard merits.<br /> <br /> Expanded Storyteller Chapter. By, like, a lot. We've got good stuff in there.<br /> <br /> More Hedge. Hedge Hedge Hedge.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Ensorcellment, unless I'm blind and missing it.</div> </div> </div> </div>In a perfect world, I'd love to do a lot of shorter supplements, addressing more specific content. And in each, I would offer one or two Freeholds that show the ideas in action a little bit. <br /> <br /> Cape Town might be rough, since I don't know any solid writers from there, and in my experience, outsiders dealing with South Africa ends up... let's just say not that great. That said, I'm also not too keen on building on the core. I'd MUCH rather get the core out, and start working on additional content. I'm a huge fan of getting out more material. <br /> <br /> And more Storytelling? That's interesting. I do like what we've got in there. I felt I did the best I could within the limitations I had. I didn't want to do a bunch of 101 shit, so I think we had some really fun tools to get people thinking. I'd love to do a Changeling Storytelling Companion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:16:37-08:00","id":1027419,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027406#post1027406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know nothing about any of this, just to preface. I heard about it in the meeting notes, same as you. But, if it's a thing we end up doing, what kind of expanded material would you all like to see? Assume I'm already looking at treatment of additional kith options, and of course I've already discussed further treatment of the Hedge.</div> </div> </div> </div> More Courts, especially essentials like Seelie and Directional. <br /> <br /> More contracts, including goblin. <br /> <br /> The Hedge Shaper Merit Template we discussed in the past<br /> <br /> More entitlements including Eldritch Entitlements like the Lost Pantheon, Black Apple, and Vizers. <br /> <br /> More goblin fruit, tokens, ect... <br /> <br /> Changelings in the underworld (it's suggested in the Gravewright kith that Changelings sometimes visit it before escaping Arcadia and in fact escaping Arcadia via the Underworld instead of via the Hedge would make for an interesting new Seeming. <br /> <br /> Updated Grimm Seeming and that Lucky/Random Seeming you talked about. <br /> <br /> Books like Mummy: DC/Rio for say places like Toronto, Tokyo, Paris, Miami, ect... <br /> <br /> Rules for Changeling Ghosts. <br /> <br /> Rules for playing Cambions and Fetches. <br /> <br /> Can Changelings Father/Mother Cambions? <br /> <br /> The return of Morpheans. <br /> <br /> A book for elder Changeling games like A Thousand Years of Night is for Vampires. <br /> <br /> Sometime so awesome it would never occur to me, but which I will love upon hearing of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:18:48-08:00","id":1027421,"title":"","content":"People ninja'd me on the courts/settings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:23:40-08:00","id":1027422,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027417#post1027417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dreaming would be a thing I'd love to work with. I know we gave it a little more attention in this book, but we had some hardcore space limitations. I think we have some great building blocks to start with.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why there is always to little space to work on the really cool things? Dreaming was on of the best and to be honest one of the most unfulfilled things from the 1ED. Especially that there are so great inspiration materials for oneiromancy (movies such as Ink or Paprika, not to mention Inception; books and comics, and so on). I'm keeping my fingers crossed for more treatment of dreamscape and oneiromancy in 2ED. In a perfect world dreaming would get its own short supplement but I'm all too aware that our world is far from perfect...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2637-qendi","name":"qendi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:26:04-08:00","id":1027424,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027417#post1027417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm DEFINITELY interested in doing more Courts and Freeholds. I love them, too. I don't know that I'd favor putting them in the core, but they're definitely a place I'd love to hit home on hard. Hell, I'd love to do a whole book of them in a perfect situation.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'd buy books of settings for every single gameline, even the ones I don't care for. Not that the word of one gal matters much, but just saying: I love me some cities. The alternate Courts we saw in 1e were of varying quality but had some very fun ideas, and seeing them get new life and more fully-baked thought behind them in example settings would be a treat, to say nothing of how fun entirely new stuff will be. Changeling plays so much with local folklore that seeing some of that from less well-known cultures would be a treat.<br /> <br /> Just... please, have someone who actually knows about SoCal do the next treatment of San Diego if it ever happens again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:26:20-08:00","id":1027425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>qendi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027422#post1027422\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why there is always to little space to work on the really cool things? Dreaming was on of the best and to be honest one of the most unfulfilled things from the 1ED. Especially that there are so great inspiration materials for oneiromancy (movies such as Ink or Paprika, not to mention Inception; books and comics, and so on). I'm keeping my fingers crossed for more treatment of dreamscape and oneiromancy in 2ED. In a perfect world dreaming would get its own short supplement but I'm all too aware that our world is far from perfect...</div> </div> </div> </div>I wanted to get some content from some of the supplements into the core. And the core was tight. It had the same word count as Requiem, for example. But, Requiem is a far less complex game when it comes to the core concepts. Just getting all the necessary bases covered and playable took a lot of space. <br /> <br /> I didn't even get to do a full treatment of Huntsmen in the way Requiem did with Strix, for example. Just wasn't a realistic thing to do. We also shaved off a ton of words with Contracts in this edition, which made room for more than I initially expected.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:34:39-08:00","id":1027430,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027424#post1027424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Just... please, have someone who actually knows about SoCal do the next treatment of San Diego if it ever happens again.</div> </div> </div> </div>Had I served in San Diego, I'd love to. Sadly, I got Riverside County.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:35:44-08:00","id":1027431,"title":"","content":"Changeling at all times is a game of many rabbits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:36:52-08:00","id":1027433,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027425#post1027425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wanted to get some content from some of the supplements into the core. And the core was tight. It had the same word count as Requiem, for example. But, Requiem is a far less complex game when it comes to the core concepts. Just getting all the necessary bases covered and playable took a lot of space.<br /> <br /> I didn't even get to do a full treatment of Huntsmen in the way Requiem did with Strix, for example. Just wasn't a realistic thing to do. We also shaved off a ton of words with Contracts in this edition, which made room for more than I initially expected.</div> </div> </div> </div>Word count is a b***h, I'm struggling with it everyday so I kind of know how that feels. But here is where the Kickstarter gets in to expand the book <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. Exalted KS added tons of cool stuff into the book, and Dark Eras had a great <i>vox populi</i> added content. I think that's why all of us here want Changeling to get its own Kickstarter <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2637-qendi","name":"qendi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:40:20-08:00","id":1027434,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>qendi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027433#post1027433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Word count is a b***h, I'm struggling with it everyday so I kind of know how that feels. But here is where the Kickstarter gets in to expand the book <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. Exalted KS added tons of cool stuff into the book, and Dark Eras had a great <i>vox populi</i> added content. I think that's why all of us here want Changeling to get its own Kickstarter <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'd prefer the book come out sooner than later, so I can get on OTHER books <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:40:21-08:00","id":1027435,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027425#post1027425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I wanted to get some content from some of the supplements into the core. And the core was tight. It had the same word count as Requiem, for example. But, Requiem is a far less complex game when it comes to the core concepts. Just getting all the necessary bases covered and playable took a lot of space.<br /> <br /> I didn't even get to do a full treatment of Huntsmen in the way Requiem did with Strix, for example. Just wasn't a realistic thing to do. We also shaved off a ton of words with Contracts in this edition, which made room for more than I initially expected.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well than those are the top of my list for what I want expanded: the stuff you had to cut that you feel makes the baseline full.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:40:31-08:00","id":1027436,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027430#post1027430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Had I served in San Diego, I'd love to. Sadly, I got Riverside County.</div> </div> </div> </div>Feel free to visit sometime, we have a dynamite food scene and my part of town has a giant Pride flag installed over it by the city.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>qendi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027433#post1027433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Word count is a b***h, I'm struggling with it everyday so I kind of know how that feels. But here is where the Kickstarter gets in to expand the book <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. Exalted KS added tons of cool stuff into the book, and Dark Eras had a great <i>vox populi</i> added content. I think that's why all of us here want Changeling to get its own Kickstarter <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>The important thing is that as little of the stretch goals as possible needs to go into core, so as to delay it ideally not at all. It hurts me that it's the case, but most RPG companies have learned that lesson the hard way.<br /> <br /> But god yes, could we please get more polls for stretch goal content? That was a blast in Dark Eras.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:43:10-08:00","id":1027439,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027435#post1027435\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Since there's a kickstarter this time, any chance stretchgoals will expand wordcount to get the lost Contract stuff and full Huntsmen write-up in?</div> </div> </div> </div>I didn't actually cut any content from Contracts. I just shaved word count. I made them take as little as possible wherever possible. And the way I formatted the new style made them take significantly less space than the old ones. <br /> <br /> As far as the Huntsmen go, there's not really a 'full writeup' to do. The content's in there. But I went with a completely different style of treatment on them than Rose went with the Strix. There might be ways I could expand that, but I feel like they're as self-contained as they need to be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:43:29-08:00","id":1027440,"title":"","content":"*delete*------------------","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:45:33-08:00","id":1027443,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027436#post1027436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The important thing is that as little of the stretch goals as possible needs to go into core, so as to delay it ideally not at all. It hurts me that it's the case, but most RPG companies have learned that lesson the hard way.<br /> <br /> But god yes, could we please get more polls for stretch goal content? That was a blast in Dark Eras.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, as little into corebook as possible (cf. Exlated) but extra sourcebooks are still fine new stuff <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2637-qendi","name":"qendi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:45:50-08:00","id":1027444,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027436#post1027436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The important thing is that as little of the stretch goals as possible needs to go into core, so as to delay it ideally not at all. It hurts me that it's the case, but most RPG companies have learned that lesson the hard way.</div> </div> </div> </div>And frankly? My writers get paid when the book is published. Stretch goal content pushes back their paychecks. And they've already been waiting a very long time. The last final draft was submitted to me this summer. So I'd hate to make them (and myself) wait longer. I'd rather my talent start cracking on further paychecks. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027436#post1027436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But god yes, could we please get more polls for stretch goal content? That was a blast in Dark Eras.</div> </div> </div> </div>That'd be pretty cool. I thought it was a neat idea. Although I'd really want to reserve some content for myself, since 100% creation by democracy I think can really hurt games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:46:42-08:00","id":1027447,"title":"","content":"Ooo, how about some example Keepers? Is that something folks would like to see? I've always wanted that, a sort of &quot;here's their Titles, here's their domain, here's some specific Kith permutations likely to arise from a Durance under them.&quot;<br /> <br /> My Arkham setting had that, come to think of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:49:37-08:00","id":1027449,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027447#post1027447\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ooo, how about some example Keepers? Is that something folks would like to see? I've always wanted that, a sort of &quot;here's their Titles, here's their domain, here's some specific Kith permutations likely to arise from a Durance under them.&quot;<br /> <br /> My Arkham setting had that, come to think of it.</div> </div> </div> </div>That was absolutely a thing I wanted to do more of in the core, but lacked space. It's totally a thing I'd love to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:50:01-08:00","id":1027450,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027444#post1027444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And frankly? My writers get paid when the book is published. Stretch goal content pushes back their paychecks. And they've already been waiting a very long time. The last final draft was submitted to me this summer. So I'd hate to make them (and myself) wait longer. I'd rather my talent start cracking on further paychecks.</div> </div> </div> </div>We all wish you as large and as fast paychecks as possible, I think <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> but the community wants more stuff at the same time. Would putting new stuff through KS as independent small sourcebooks be (from developer and writers point of veiw) better than adding content directly to a sourcebook?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2637-qendi","name":"qendi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T21:59:12-08:00","id":1027454,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027449#post1027449\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That was absolutely a thing I wanted to do more of in the core, but lacked space. It's totally a thing I'd love to do.</div> </div> </div> </div>Can I briefly express how affirming it is to have you like my ideas?<br /> <br /> Gosh, I'm excited for this book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T02:41:33-08:00","id":1027503,"title":"","content":"Something I would love to see is Changeling specific holidays; though they are trying to keep their humanity about them, I get the feeling that there would be some fae specific events that would constitute as a holiday of some sort for fae beings. Times of celebration, or mourning, or even just days where specific things are more likely to happen. A day when the moon rises with its own Mask, and those who gaze at its mien become lieterally drunk in its glory, or a specific night where the mask fades ever so slightly on a Changeling, or one where teacups placed upside down on a hearth can cause strange seeds to emerge in the cups provided the houseowner is respectful. However, such events only come to be in areas where there are sufficient Changelings who expect it to happen, msybe even being limited to particular households, building a mini-domain with the belief...or something. I really like the aspects of Changeling culture we have gotten, and I would like some of these aspects gathered further.<br /> <br /> Of course, this kind of thing might already exist or just be freehold/court specific, so I dunno. It is late here as I write this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T04:29:19-08:00","id":1027535,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>qendi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027450#post1027450\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> We all wish you as large and as fast paychecks as possible, I think <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> but the community wants more stuff at the same time. Would putting new stuff through KS as independent small sourcebooks be (from developer and writers point of veiw) better than adding content directly to a sourcebook?</div> </div> </div> </div>I find it better both for the writers' payment sake, and because it lets us review the final core content and adapt it to suit. <br /> <br /> A couple of times, I've seen content built for Kickstarter expansions that was based on pre-final content (usually the &quot;almost final&quot; Kickstarter content) that didn't quite match the final core book content. Whereas supplement material built for separate books works on a slightly different urgency, so it fits better. This is generally pretty minor stuff, but I find it irksome as a developer. I prefer to let the core book &quot;cook&quot; a little in its final form before I have writers working on material. That way I'm 100% sure they're working off final material, and they're not as rushed. <br /> <br /> If you want a really good example of this phenomenon, 1E Requiem's supplement &quot;The Blood&quot; was mostly written before the final version of Requiem. And it shows. Even though some of the writers had access to the final, sometimes it's hard to let that final material sink in, reconciling the differences between the pre-release versions and the print version. For another example, I still have some misconceptions about what is in the final version of Beast, despite reading the final version a couple of times. I spent over a year on the original material, but only those two readthroughs of the final. If I were asked to do supplement material for Beast within a month or so of the final's release, I'd probably botch that in a couple of places.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T05:37:46-08:00","id":1027557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027444#post1027444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And frankly? My writers get paid when the book is published. Stretch goal content pushes back their paychecks. And they've already been waiting a very long time. The last final draft was submitted to me this summer. So I'd hate to make them (and myself) wait longer. I'd rather my talent start cracking on further paychecks. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> That'd be pretty cool. I thought it was a neat idea. Although I'd really want to reserve some content for myself, since 100% creation by democracy I think can really hurt games.</div> </div> </div> </div> This yes this, absolutely, let the stretch goals focus on supplements and an interactive audio story. <br /> <br /> I mean David has shown us what 75% to 80% of the content already, it extremely complete and functional as it is. Frankly I amazed at out how he and his team fit so much into that amount of space.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 01-06-2017, 12:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T08:46:56-08:00","id":1027698,"title":"","content":"It'd be nice if Court Creation got a bit more love too, in a world where we get a Freeholds book. For example, offering some ideas in way of Titles and Rituals so people creating courts can cherry pick ideas instead of working from scratch. Lords of Summer did great things for the Seasonal Courts and something like that but more open to all types of courts would be cool. <br /> <br /> Definitely more Dreamwalking, maybe discuss some crossover implications of it too. It could fit really well into the Hedge book since Dreams are in the Hedge!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10769-llegume","name":"LLegume","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T14:37:44-08:00","id":1027852,"title":"","content":"One request I'd like for the Hedge Supplement or whatever's appropriate: Guidelines for Storytellers on creating your own hobgoblins, including some tips on roleplaying their strange mindsets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T14:44:02-08:00","id":1027854,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027406#post1027406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know nothing about any of this, just to preface. I heard about it in the meeting notes, same as you. But, if it's a thing we end up doing, what kind of expanded material would you all like to see? Assume I'm already looking at treatment of additional kith options, and of course I've already discussed further treatment of the Hedge.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would like to see more on hobgoblins. Specifically, I'd like to see a bit more on how some of their settlements and cultures work. Of course, I wouldn't be opposed to a bestiary full of Hedgebeasts either.<br /> <br /> I'd like to see more goblin fruits, and maybe even some interesting things that changelings can do with them. Think something like Hedge alchemy.<br /> <br /> Like so many others, I'd love to see more freeholds detailed.<br /> <br /> I really want the updated Grimm seeming, with more depth given to the roles that they adopt.<br /> <br /> I'll add my voice to the chorus requesting more dream-related material. <br /> <br /> I would also like to see Talecrafting updated for 2nd edition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T14:46:01-08:00","id":1027857,"title":"","content":"Nomadic freehold rules might be interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T16:10:39-08:00","id":1027900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027857#post1027857\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nomadic freehold rules might be interesting.</div> </div> </div> </div>They operate the same way. But a sample nomadic freehold'll pop up somewhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T16:20:10-08:00","id":1027904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027900#post1027900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They operate the same way. But a sample nomadic freehold'll pop up somewhere.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've briefly toyed on the idea of a mobile freehold based around a firebase during Vietnam, so I'd love to see some official guidance there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T17:47:38-08:00","id":1027945,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BronzeDog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027852#post1027852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One request I'd like for the Hedge Supplement or whatever's appropriate: Guidelines for Storytellers on creating your own hobgoblins, including some tips on roleplaying their strange mindsets.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait, was it said Core wont have guidelines/rules for creating your own hobgoblins? Every 2e gameline so far has given tools to make the opponents, so it'd be rather annoying if changeling didn't.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T17:57:26-08:00","id":1027949,"title":"","content":"If we do a KS, I'd favor doing additional books rather than adding to the core book size. I can think of some reasons we would add to the first book, but, as David says, we have space limitations on core books. More likely, we'd do a set of goals external to it. Those might be smaller books, as we did with <i>Demon</i> and <i>Beast</i>, or they might be larger books that get added to over several stretch goals, as we did with <i>V20 Dark Ages</i> and <i>Pugmire</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T20:35:08-08:00","id":1028010,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027945#post1027945\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, was it said Core wont have guidelines/rules for creating your own hobgoblins? Every 2e gameline so far has given tools to make the opponents, so it'd be rather annoying if changeling didn't.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, but I'd like a Hedge supplement go into particular depth on the subject.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T01:16:00-08:00","id":1028063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BronzeDog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1028010#post1028010\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, but I'd like a Hedge supplement go into particular depth on the subject.</div> </div> </div> </div>With things like what you get when you get to the top of the Hedge and look at what constitutes a sky? Or try to dig under it? Or if the Hedge somehow embodies various very ancient myths and actually has an edge to it you could fall off of?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T08:04:43-08:00","id":1028153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027949#post1027949\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If we do a KS, I'd favor doing additional books rather than adding to the core book size. I can think of some reasons we would add to the first book, but, as David says, we have space limitations on core books. More likely, we'd do a set of goals external to it. Those might be smaller books, as we did with <i>Demon</i> and <i>Beast</i>, or they might be larger books that get added to over several stretch goals, as we did with <i>V20 Dark Ages</i> and <i>Pugmire</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div> I'm absolutely fine with that, it's completely logical.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T11:58:52-08:00","id":1028222,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taidragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1028063#post1028063\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> With things like what you get when you get to the top of the Hedge and look at what constitutes a sky? Or try to dig under it? Or if the Hedge somehow embodies various very ancient myths and actually has an edge to it you could fall off of?</div> </div> </div> </div>Quick answers:<ul><li>You can summit Everest or similar in the Hedge. Attempts at escaping Earth itself probably result in the object traveling through weird darkness and weather for a long time, then emerging in some unlikely place like at the bottom of an iced over lake, or in a burial mound no one's touched in a thousand years.</li> <li>You can dig as far in the Hedge as you can on Earth. You'll dig up some really strange things, though. If you drill for oil, you might find oil that constantly boils and whose bubbles each show the reflections of grinning skulls before they burst. Ditto precious metals -- watch the heck out for goblin gold!</li> <li>You could say that the Hedge is round, because no amount of walking will find an edge, and if you were ludicrously well-supplied and lucky, you could maybe circumnavigate it. But distance behaves in strange ways and the scenery changes, so trying to calculate a geography of the Hedge doesn't work. And you might find places where it seems to have an edge, in that cliffs drop off into apparent nothingness and if you had set up some way of sensing if an object hit ground, it would never register. (The object might also come crashing out of the sky and slam into the ground, leaving a mile-wide crater in which you then discover a species of inch-tall amazons who have evolved beyond military adventurism and into a complex but self-sustaining police state.)</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T12:17:40-08:00","id":1028227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1028222#post1028222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[*]You could say that the Hedge is round, because no amount of walking will find an edge, and if you were ludicrously well-supplied and lucky, you could maybe circumnavigate it. But distance behaves in strange ways and the scenery changes, so trying to calculate a geography of the Hedge doesn't work. And you might find places where it seems to have an edge, in that cliffs drop off into apparent nothingness and if you had set up some way of sensing if an object hit ground, it would never register. (The object might also come crashing out of the sky and slam into the ground, leaving a mile-wide crater in which you then discover a species of inch-tall amazons who have evolved beyond military adventurism and into a complex but self-sustaining police state.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that some of the art in the Hedge book should be of this scenario...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10769-llegume","name":"LLegume","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T12:34:33-08:00","id":1028234,"title":"","content":"I've decided that the sci-fi dreams of Buena Vista have influenced the local Hedge: Go high enough, and the thorns give way to an asteroid thicket with space whales and such.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T13:38:13-08:00","id":1028253,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1028222#post1028222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Quick answers:<ul><li>You can summit Everest or similar in the Hedge. Attempts at escaping Earth itself probably result in the object traveling through weird darkness and weather for a long time, then emerging in some unlikely place like at the bottom of an iced over lake, or in a burial mound no one's touched in a thousand years.</li> <li>You can dig as far in the Hedge as you can on Earth. You'll dig up some really strange things, though. If you drill for oil, you might find oil that constantly boils and whose bubbles each show the reflections of grinning skulls before they burst. Ditto precious metals -- watch the heck out for goblin gold!</li> <li>You could say that the Hedge is round, because no amount of walking will find an edge, and if you were ludicrously well-supplied and lucky, you could maybe circumnavigate it. But distance behaves in strange ways and the scenery changes, so trying to calculate a geography of the Hedge doesn't work. And you might find places where it seems have an edge, in that cliffs drop off into apparent nothingness and if you had set up some way of sensing if an object hit ground, it would never register. (The object might also come crashing out of the sky and slam into the ground, leaving a mile-wide crater in which you then discover a species of inch-tall amazons who have evolved beyond military adventurism and into a complex but self-sustaining police state.)</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Reading that felt like intruding on your acid trip, top shelf acid. Awesome I love it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T18:16:37-08:00","id":1033069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027406#post1027406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know nothing about any of this, just to preface. I heard about it in the meeting notes, same as you. But, if it's a thing we end up doing, what kind of expanded material would you all like to see? Assume I'm already looking at treatment of additional kith options, and of course I've already discussed further treatment of the Hedge.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know I'm late to the party, but here goes:<br /> - As many new books as possible. I love the content and theme of Changeling, and just enjoy reading it. I have all the 1st edition supplementary books (Seasonal, Equinox, Dusk/Dawn, Goblin Markets, Night Horrors, Victorian Lost) and I would not be mad if this edition got all the seasons and more as well. But as for specifics...<br /> - More antagonists. Anything concerning Hobgoblins and the Gentry are A-OK with me.<br /> - Dreaming. That was cool and I'd love more. Let's have an oneiroparty.<br /> - Roma. Some people have mentioned them, and I have Romani blood. I think they'd be neat to focus on, although I'm admittedly biased.<br /> - Seems like more Hedge is coming. Yassssssss.<br /> - A notification of some sort when the Kickstarter goes live. I do not want to miss it.<br /> - I'm sure I'll think of a million more things after I read the 2nd edition core book.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T08:06:22-08:00","id":1033368,"title":"","content":"If this is a &quot;have the manuscript and get some stretch goals unlocked by giving us money&quot; like it was done with other CoD games, I'm all for it.<br /> <br /> If this is more of a classic KS like was done with Scion, I'd still back it cause it's a great game and I have trust in OP, but I'd be a bit disappointed given how long this has been in the works already.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T08:32:15-08:00","id":1033382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daigotsu Max</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1033368#post1033368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If this is a &amp;quot;have the manuscript and get some stretch goals unlocked by giving us money&amp;quot; like it was done with other CoD games, I'm all for it.<br /> <br /> If this is more of a classic KS like was done with Scion, I'd still back it cause it's a great game and I have trust in OP, but I'd be a bit disappointed given how long this has been in the works already.</div> </div> </div> </div> Any Changeling Kickstarter will unlikely effect the corebook much, it's in the very end of the development phase, David handed the book over for approval by Onyx Path and White Wolf, and then it will likely go to art direction and Layout. It's already further along then Scion is when Scion did their kickstarter .<br /> <br /> So most stretch goals will likely be for stuff like separate extra books (such as The Hedge book that Onyx Path has already announced, but not started yet) or a deluxe edition for the physical book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-24T21:13:18-08:00","id":1037648,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027417#post1027417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm DEFINITELY interested in doing more Courts and Freeholds. I love them, too. I don't know that I'd favor putting them in the core, but they're definitely a place I'd love to hit home on hard. Hell, I'd love to do a whole book of them in a perfect situation.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have one city's name for you, and I bet you can guess what it is. <br /> <br /> Duuuuubaiiii...<br /> <br /> Actually, Dubai, Dar Es Salam, and Zanzibar would all be killer locations for pretty much the same reason. Changelings can map to pretty much any mythological creature, but they are one of the best splats for portraying Islamic Jinn (spirits and Unchained being the other primary contenders). Any (or even better, all) of those location would be bitching.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-24T23:14:53-08:00","id":1037687,"title":"","content":"Perth/Western Australia would be a freehold I'm interested in. So many spirits in the myths are humanoid in shape like goanna men and I'd imagine there's a lot that can be done with a culture who had their stories taken away from them in a game like Changeling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":8331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","user":"milo v3","date":". 01-25-2017, 02:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-26T16:41:39-08:00","id":1038641,"title":"","content":"Anybody else having a really hard time waiting for this? I check the forums everyday now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-26T18:09:41-08:00","id":1038669,"title":"","content":"I might've missed something or just plainly misremember, but wasn't that Monday Meeting Notes news to the devs as well that there might be new kickstarters? If they haven't planned a kickstarter until this late in production I'd say the odds for Changeling 2E getting a kickstarter is far from a safe bet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-26T18:16:45-08:00","id":1038670,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E11even-E11even</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1038641#post1038641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anybody else having a really hard time waiting for this? I check the forums everyday now.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1038669#post1038669\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I might've missed something or just plainly misremember, but wasn't that Monday Meeting Notes news to the devs as well that there might be new kickstarters? If they haven't planned a kickstarter until this late in production I'd say the odds for Changeling 2E getting a kickstarter is far from a safe bet.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's something we're seriously considering. We won't spring it on everybody with no announcement, though. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href